# untracked-arm defect repro (round 67 lesson Mistake 3): the original selftest arm fed the
# evaluator a commitless fixture; the evaluator correctly refuses could-not-evaluate (exit 2),
# so the arm's expectation (UNTRACKED, exit 1) could never be met - the arm was wrong, not the evaluator
$ python tools/round67-worktree-landing-check.py --repo <commitless fixture with untracked u.md> --paths u.md
WORKTREE_LANDING_CHECK could-not-evaluate: HEAD unresolvable: fatal: Needed a single revision
exit=2
